---
import { 
  Key, 
  Radio, 
  Cpu, 
  ArrowRight, 
  ExternalLink,
  Layers,
  Sparkles,
  RefreshCw,
  Server,
  Check
} from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-[#faf9f5] dark:bg-[#0b0f19] border-b border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-purple-800 dark:text-purple-300 border border-purple-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/80 mb-3">
        <Layers class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400" />
        <span class="font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">Protokol Mimarisi</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white leading-[1.15]">
        Nostr Nasıl Çalışır?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Geleneksel sosyal ağlar tek bir şirketin sunucusuna bağlıdır. Nostr ise <span class="font-semibold text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300">"Çoklu İstemci, Çoklu Röle" (Multi-Master)</span> mimarisi ve <span class="font-semibold text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300">Outbox (Gossip) Modeli</span> ile çalışır.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Stepped Outbox Architecture Flow -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-16">
      
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-purple-400 dark:hover:border-purple-600 transition-all shadow-xs relative flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-purple-50 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 border border-purple-200/60 dark:border-purple-800/60">
              ADIM 01
            </span>
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-950/80 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300">
              <Key class="w-4 h-4" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            Outbox Röleleri Belirlenir
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Kullanıcı (NIP-65 ile) içeriklerini hangi rölelere (örneğin <code>relay.nostr.org.tr</code>) yazacağını ağa anons eder.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-400">
          NIP-65 Relay List Metadata
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-purple-400 dark:hover:border-purple-600 transition-all shadow-xs relative flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-purple-50 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 border border-purple-200/60 dark:border-purple-800/60">
              ADIM 02
            </span>
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-950/80 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300">
              <Radio class="w-4 h-4" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            Hedefli İstemci Bağlantısı
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Sizi takip edenlerin istemcileri, anons ettiğiniz röleleri bulur ve sadece o rölelerden verilerinizi çeker.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-400">
          Direct Query Routing
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-purple-400 dark:hover:border-purple-600 transition-all shadow-xs relative flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-purple-50 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 border border-purple-200/60 dark:border-purple-800/60">
              ADIM 03
            </span>
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-950/80 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300">
              <RefreshCw class="w-4 h-4" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            Röle Değişimi & Sıfır Kayıp
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Kullandığınız bir röle kapansa veya sizi engellese bile yeni bir röle seçersiniz; takipçileriniz otomatik olarak yeni röleye yönelir.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-400">
          Censorship Resilient Flow
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-purple-400 dark:hover:border-purple-600 transition-all shadow-xs relative flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-purple-50 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 border border-purple-200/60 dark:border-purple-800/60">
              ADIM 04
            </span>
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-950/80 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300">
              <Cpu class="w-4 h-4" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            Kullanıcı Temsilcisi İstemciler
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            İstemciler sadece "görüntüleyici" değil, kullanıcının adına çalışan akıllı temsilcilerdir. Veriyi doğrular ve yerel olarak işler.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-400">
          Client-Side Verification
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Deep Dive Architecture Bento: Protocol vs Relays -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-stretch">
      
      <!-- Box 1: Ownerless Protocol vs Owned Relays -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200 border border-amber-200/80 dark:border-amber-800/80 mb-4">
            <Sparkles class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" />
            <span>Ağ Felsefesi</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">
            Protokol Sahipsizdir, Röleler Değildir
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Nostr soyut bir ifade özgürlüğü vaadiyle değil, <strong>birlikte olma ve ayrılma özgürlüğü (freedom of association)</strong> temeliyle çalışır. Her sunucu özel mülkiyettir ve kendi topluluk kurallarını belirler.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700/80">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">
                Merkezi Ağlar
              </h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Şirket hesabınızı sildiğinde takipçilerinizi, verinizi ve dijital varlığınızı tamamen kaybedersiniz.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-purple-50/70 dark:bg-purple-950/40 border border-purple-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/80">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-900 dark:text-purple-300 mb-1">
                Nostr Modeli
              </h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Bir röle sizi kabul etmezse, diğer onlarca röleye yayın yapar veya dakikalar içinde kendi rölenizi açarsınız.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-5 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-3">
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
            Kendi rölenizi kurmak ister misiniz?
          </span>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/hoytech/strfry" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 hover:text-purple-900 dark:hover:text-purple-100"
          >
            <span>strfry & Khatru rölelerini inceleyin</span>
            <ExternalLink class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Box 2: Smart Clients & Dumb Relays -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900 dark:bg-slate-900/95 text-white border border-slate-800 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-white/10 text-purple-200 border border-white/20 mb-4">
            <Server class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-purple-300" />
            <span>Mühendislik İlkesi</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            Akıllı İstemciler, Hafif Röleler
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Geleneksel web2'de sunucu tüm mantığı yöneten devasa bir tekeldir. Nostr'da ise röleler yalnızca iletileri saklayan basit borulardır; içeriklerin geçerliliğini ve kimlik doğrulamalarını sizin cihazınızdaki açık kaynak istemci yapar.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="p-0.5 rounded bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 mt-0.5">
                <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-purple-300" />
              </span>
              <span>İmzalanmış iletiler sunucu tarafından değiştirilemez (imza bozulur).</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="p-0.5 rounded bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 mt-0.5">
                <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-purple-300" />
              </span>
              <span>Kullanıcı istediği istemciyi (Damus, Amethyst, Coracle vb.) özgürce seçer.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="p-0.5 rounded bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 mt-0.5">
                <Check class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-purple-300" />
              </span>
              <span>İstemci birden fazla röleyle paralel konuşarak sansürü imkansız kılar.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-5 border-t border-slate-800">
          <a 
            href="/rehber" 
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-purple-300 hover:text-white transition-colors"
          >
            <span>İstemci Seçim Kılavuzunu Oku</span>
            <ArrowRight class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
